REPOSITORY AGENT RULES

1. The root README.md is the only Markdown document permitted in this repository.
2. Never create, stage, or commit any other Markdown file. This includes AGENTS.md,
   CLAUDE.md, status files, plans, setup guides, nested README files, and files
   ending in .md, .mdx, .markdown, .mdown, or .mkd.
3. Put durable project documentation in the root README.md. Put short technical
   explanations next to the code they describe.
4. Before staging or committing, run `npm run check:markdown` and remove every
   reported file rather than ignoring it.
5. Keep `agentRules: false` in next.config.ts so Next.js does not regenerate
   AGENTS.md or CLAUDE.md during development.
